BigBasket Data Analysis Capstone Project

Project Overview

This project analyzes BigBasket sales data to understand sales performance, customer and product information, category-wise revenue, and overall business performance. The project uses SQL, Excel, and Tableau to clean, analyze, and present the data. The analysis includes database creation, SQL queries, spreadsheet analysis, and an interactive Tableau dashboard. The main goal is to identify which product categories are performing above or below their revenue targets and provide useful recommendations for the category team.

